      "rationale": "典型节点失守。"
    },
    {
      "id": "meta-time-choice-gate:trigger-02",
      "type": "should_trigger",
      "prompt": "每次开工前我都会先点开微信，明明任务很明确。",
      "expected": "meta-time-choice-gate",
      "rationale": "启动前自动动作。"
    },
    {
      "id": "meta-time-choice-gate:trigger-03",
      "type": "should_trigger",
      "prompt": "客户说话很冲，我想立刻回怼，怎么让自己先停一下？",
      "expected": "meta-time-choice-gate",
      "rationale": "冲动回复前需要守门。"
    },
    {
      "id": "meta-time-choice-gate:not-01",
      "type": "should_not_trigger",
      "prompt": "我现在因为愤怒想辞职，觉得脑子带宽不够，需要先判断能不能做决定。",
